<title>USA: Sevierville, Tenn., won by First Tennessee.</title>
<headline>Sevierville, Tenn., won by First Tennessee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $3.500 million of Sevierville, Tenn., water and sewer revenue and tax bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.522 percent.</p>
</text>
